16:9 科技爆款封面海报，大师级商业平面设计，黑金与电光蓝高端配色。\n画面主体： 一匹极具力量感的纯黑汗血骏马在暗夜光影中腾空跃起，肌肉线条凌厉雕塑感十足，油亮的黑曜石般皮毛泛着冷冽金属高光，飞扬的鬃毛化作流动的暗金与蔚蓝AI数据流粒子。\n文字排版： 画面左侧或上方预留视觉焦点，采用极具视觉冲击力的3D金属质感大字居中偏左排版——主标题为发光冷白拼香槟金立体粗体大字**“Moss image文生图”；主标题下方搭配科技感半透明磨砂胶囊底框，内嵌醒目亮青色副标题“超级黑马8步 LORA + VOSR2 一键放大仅需30秒”**。\n背景与光影： 深邃暗调赛博科技空间背景，戏剧性伦勃朗侧逆轮廓光勾勒黑马英姿，地面轻微镜面反射，景深虚化，8K超高清，极致毛发与光影细节，苹果发布会级高端视觉，吸睛抓人。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [69, 71, 75], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [1537.6063232421875, 1890.7427978515625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 22, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 27, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 12}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.55.17", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [-1173.1255751088977, -1831.7805339636168], "scale": 0.8769226950000016}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "sft", "bounding": [551.1082153320312, 1786.0826416015625, 1787.6453857421875, 559.40771484375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "mode", "bounding": [-428.4084167480469, 1783.193115234375, 944.9317626953125, 686.9827880859375]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "比例分辨率选择", "bounding": [-427.01